  "claim": "Charles Barton \"Chuck\" Kendall, Jr. was reportedly interested in purchasing the team which Danilo Gallinari plays for. The current owner is a Jewish-American businessman, whose lead counsel was Bobby Samini.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Charlie Kendall. Sentence: In 1982, Kendall was reportedly interested in purchasing the Los Angeles Clippers from owner Donald Sterling but Sterling did not sell.\nPage: Donald Sterling. Sentence: Donald T. Sterling (born Donald Tokowitz; April 26, 1934) is a Jewish-American businessman.\nPage: Bobby Samini. Sentence: Samini has represented many high-profile clients, including serving as lead counsel to former Los Angeles Clippers owner Donald Sterling in highly publicized litigation with the National Basketball Association, TMZ, and V. Stiviano.\nPage: Danilo Gallinari. Sentence: Danilo Gallinari (] ; born August 8, 1988) is an Italian professional basketball player for the Los Angeles Clippers of the National Basketball Association (NBA).",
